      "value": "I've encountered this issue today myself, as well as the list of of instances not updating issue too (as described in this canny post: https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/1238-world-instances-list-does-not-refreshupdate )\n\nFrom what I was able to figure out, it seems to appear when opening a world in menu that has a lot of public and/or group public instances, while for worlds that doesn't have many public/group public instances it doesn't appear that often.\n\nEdit (24.11.2024): I've tried logging out and logging back in VRChat without restarting the game and the issue dissapeared for a bit.",
